#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:224
msgid ""
"Administrator-managed durable policy. Source allow entries provide explicit trusted access, permanent block"
" entries stop the source before WordPress routing, and exact request exceptions scope automatic profile "
"matching. Smart adaptive response stays in its adaptive layer, while this section remains fully "
"administrator-controlled with self-lockout protection."
msgstr ""
"Beartas marthanach faoi bhainistíocht an riarthóra. Soláthraíonn iontrálacha ceadaithe foinse rochtain "
"iontaofa sainráite, stopann iontrálacha blocála buana an fhoinse roimh routing WordPress, agus teorannaíonn"
" eisceachtaí iarratais beachta meaitseáil próifíle uathoibríoch. Fanann freagairt oiriúnaitheach chliste "
"ina sraith oiriúnaitheach, agus fanann an chuid seo faoi rialú iomlán an riarthóra le cosaint in aghaidh "
"féinghlasála."

