"mheaitseálann REMOTE_ADDR an liosta seo."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:226
msgid "One absolute path per line. A trailing * means prefix match, for example /private-export/*. Up to 100 rules."
msgstr ""
"Cosán absalóideach amháin in aghaidh na líne. Ciallaíonn * ag an deireadh meaitseáil réimíre, mar shampla "
"/private-export/*. Suas le 100 riail."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1409
msgid "One clear authority for each layer"
msgstr "Údarás soiléir amháin do gach sraith"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1927
msgid ""
"One directive plus one or more origins per line. Exact origins and wildcard subdomains are accepted; paths "
"and query strings are deliberately excluded."
msgstr ""
"Treoir amháin móide bunús amháin nó níos mó in aghaidh na líne. Glactar le bunúis bheachta agus fofhearainn"
" wildcard; eisiatar cosáin agus query strings d’aon ghnó."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:226
msgid ""
"One exact METHOD + path per line, for example GET /known-safe-endpoint. These exceptions bypass automatic "
"firewall-profile matching only; explicit source blocks, Geo Security, rate containment, virtual patches and"
" manual deny rules still take precedence. Up to 100 exceptions."
msgstr ""
"METHOD beacht amháin + cosán in aghaidh na líne, mar shampla GET /known-safe-endpoint. Seachnaíonn na "
"heisceachtaí seo meaitseáil uathoibríoch próifíle balla dóiteáin amháin; bíonn blocálacha foinse sainráite,"
" Geo Security, srian ráta, paistí fíorúla agus rialacha diúltaithe láimhe fós chun tosaigh. Suas le 100 "
"eisceacht."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1253
msgid ""
"One guarded transaction: analyze the site, snapshot the current configuration, apply a conservative "
"protection profile, verify critical surfaces, then commit or automatically roll back."
msgstr ""
"Idirbheart cosanta amháin: déan anailís ar an suíomh, tóg snapshot den chumraíocht reatha, cuir próifíl "
"choimeádach cosanta i bhfeidhm, fíoraigh dromchlaí criticiúla, ansin commit nó rollback go huathoibríoch."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1608
msgid ""
"One path per line, relative to WordPress root. Use a trailing * for a prefix. Do not ignore application "
"code merely to hide unexplained drift."
msgstr ""
"Cosán amháin in aghaidh na líne, i gcoibhneas le fréamh WordPress. Úsáid * ag an deireadh mar réimír. Ná "
"déan neamhaird de chód feidhmchláir chun drift gan mhíniú a cheilt."

