#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1417
msgid ""
"YSec compares bounded, non-secret policy fingerprints across the current WordPress network so "
"administrators can spot configuration drift."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann YSec méarloirg theoranta neamh-rúnda beartais i gcomparáid ar fud líonra reatha WordPress ionas "
"gur féidir le riarthóirí sruth cumraíochta a aithint."

#: includes/class-ysec-managed-mu.php:152
msgid "YSec could not create or write its managed runtime state directory."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir le YSec a chomhadlann stáit runtime bhainistithe a chruthú ná scríobh inti."

#: includes/class-ysec-alerts.php:43
#, php-format, python-format
msgid "YSec detected a high-confidence security condition: %s"
msgstr "Bhraith YSec riocht slándála ard-mhuiníne: %s"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1762
msgid ""
"YSec never unpacks a repair archive over the live site. Candidates are validated against the original site,"
" path and SHA-256, rescanned, encrypted in staging, and only then become ready for explicit replacement."
msgstr ""
"Ní dhíphacálann YSec cartlann deisiúcháin riamh thar an suíomh beo. Bailíochtaítear iarrthóirí in aghaidh "
"an tsuímh bhunaidh, na conaire agus SHA-256, athscantar iad, criptítear iad sa stáitsiú, agus ansin amháin "
"bíonn siad réidh d’athsholáthar sainráite."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:210
msgid ""
"YSec recognizes state-changing GET and faceted-crawl request families before the main WordPress query, "
"persists only bounded samples, and publishes a sanitized signal for YPerf origin-cost correlation."
msgstr ""
"Aithníonn YSec teaghlaigh iarratais GET a athraíonn staid agus faceted-crawl roimh phríomhcheist WordPress,"
" coinníonn sé samplaí teoranta amháin, agus foilsíonn sé comhartha sláintithe le haghaidh comhghaolú "
"chostas origin YPerf."

#: includes/class-ysec-managed-mu.php:183
msgid "YSec refused to remove a MU file it does not own."
msgstr "Dhiúltaigh YSec comhad MU nach leis é a bhaint."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1862
msgid ""
"YSec rejects abusive direct submissions before WordPress creates a comment. Normal comments that reach "
"Pending or the WordPress Spam queue remain WordPress moderation decisions, not YSec blocks."
msgstr ""
"Diúltaíonn YSec aighneachtaí díreacha mí-úsáideacha sula gcruthaíonn WordPress trácht. Fanann gnáth-"
"thráchtanna a shroicheann Pending nó scuaine Spam WordPress ina gcinntí modhnóireachta WordPress, ní ina "
"mbloic YSec."

#: includes/class-ysec-alerts.php:67
msgid "YSec security evidence summary for the last 24 hours."
msgstr "Achoimre fianaise slándála YSec don 24 uair an chloig dheireanacha."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1474
msgid "YSec target"
msgstr "Sprioc YSec"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1946
msgid ""
"YSec validates directive names, source expressions and header-injection boundaries before saving. The local"
" report endpoint is appended when report-uri is absent."
msgstr ""
"Bailíochtaíonn YSec ainmneacha treoracha, nathanna foinse agus teorainneacha insteallta ceanntásca sula "
"sábhálann sé. Cuirtear an endpoint tuairisce áitiúil leis nuair atá report-uri as láthair."

#: includes/class-ysec-doctor.php:22
msgid "YSec verifies the required indexes after dbDelta before accepting a schema upgrade as complete."
msgstr ""
"Fíoraíonn YSec na hinnéacsanna riachtanacha tar éis dbDelta sula nglacann sé le huasghrádú scéimre mar "
"chríochnaithe."

