msgstr "Yablonsky Security"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:2322
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security TOTP is configured per user. The login security-code field is shown only when at least "
"one account has it enabled."
msgstr ""
"Tá TOTP Yablonsky Security cumraithe in aghaidh an úsáideora. Ní thaispeántar réimse an chóid slándála "
"logála isteach ach nuair atá sé cumasaithe ag cuntas amháin ar a laghad."

#: includes/class-ysec-compatibility.php:51
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security detected another active security plugin. Review overlapping protection layers and assign"
" one owner to each enforcement responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Bhraith Yablonsky Security breiseán slándála gníomhach eile. Athbhreithnigh sraitheanna cosanta "
"forluiteacha agus sann úinéir amháin do gach freagracht forfheidhmithe."

#: includes/class-ysec-privacy.php:18
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security records bounded security evidence needed to protect the site. Suspicious request "
"evidence can include a salted source identifier, an encrypted source IP, user agent, a country signal "
"supplied by a validated trusted proxy, and a redacted request query. Raw request evidence expires "
"automatically according to severity, while compact non-identifying daily rollups can be kept longer for "
"security trends. Firewall blocks are time-bounded and reversible. Optional Yablonsky AI analysis is "
"disabled by default and sends a structured evidence bundle only when an administrator enables the "
"integration and explicitly requests analysis."
msgstr ""
"Taifeadann Yablonsky Security fianaise slándála theoranta a theastaíonn chun an suíomh a chosaint. "
"Féadfaidh fianaise ar iarratais amhrasacha aitheantóir foinse saillte, IP foinse criptithe, user agent, "
"comhartha tíre ó sheachfhreastalaí iontaofa bailíochtaithe, agus ceist iarratais cheilte a áireamh. Téann "
"amhfhianaise iarratais in éag go huathoibríoch de réir déine, agus is féidir rollups laethúla dlútha "
"neamhaitheantais a choinneáil níos faide do threochtaí slándála. Tá bloic bhalla dóiteáin teoranta ó thaobh"
" ama agus inchúlaithe. Tá anailís roghnach Yablonsky AI díchumasaithe de réir réamhshocraithe agus ní "
"sheolann sí beart struchtúrtha fianaise ach nuair a chumasaíonn riarthóir an comhtháthú agus a iarrann "
"anailís go sainráite."

